{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新皇崗口岸大樓港方口岸區即日起交付特區政府管轄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.CHAN-1530_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/202652Mz85bqxT1785483313.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER.CHAN-1530_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">運輸及物流局局長陳美寶亦去到皇崗新口岸，與運輸署及路政署官員視察交通安排，指示運輸署確保各項安排，包括交通指示牌等細節上，都要以用家需要出發，人潮高峰時妥善疏動人、車流。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳美寶又指局方將持續監督，指示同事準備好之後舉行的應急演練。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T08:05:31.975707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}